🟠 api in shop (prod-eu-1) keeps running out of memory. It was killed at its 512Mi memory limit; it used 505Mi at peak in the last 24 hours. Its last run lasted two hours; four restarts since its pod was created one hour ago. Fix: raise the memory limit of container app in deployment/api above 512Mi. To read the output of the last crash, run kubectl logs deploy/api -c app -n shop --previous
